-- Description:
-- Function to return the form member for the current location in the
-- Test Project Communications form.
-- Function to be replaced by method !!glbPing.refGet() is DBREF
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Function Type:   Function/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
-- Return:
--   [Data Type] [Description]
--    DBREF       Current location
--
